  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Subsidy for Battery Operated 2-Wheelers&amp;quot; by the Climate Change Department, Gujarat, aims to encourage the use of clean energy vehicles among the youth by offering financial support to students from Class 9th to 12th, as well as college students, for purchasing battery-operated two-wheelers of their choice from GEDA-authorized manufacturers through their dealers. The scheme is designed to reduce pollution, promote renewable energy adoption, and create awareness about sustainable transport among the younger generation.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a student.\n   1. The applicant must be studying in Class 9th to 12th in the state or be a college student.\n   1. The applicant must purchase a battery-operated two-wheeler only from GEDA-authorized manufacturers through registered dealers.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
